{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord \ud83d\udc49\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Someone hit the pause button on civilization...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is gone. Or is it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't the aftermath of the apocalypse. This is the first minute of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, the water's still running... if you fancy a night of gut-wrenching agony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your neighbor's lights are on, but they've got a bit of a zombie problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it's a commuter's dream right now because traffic laws are dead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't think of this as the end of the world. Think of it as the very first, chaotic day of the new world order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/23c1990f628c021a7cb73fd01dba80eb.poster.avif?t=1769151080\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/23c1990f628c021a7cb73fd01dba80eb.webm?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/23c1990f628c021a7cb73fd01dba80eb.mp4?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Common sense. It's the new superpower.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, don't overthink it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thirsty? Bust open a vending machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry? Raid someone's pantry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bitten? Welcome to the undead club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex rules. No punishing mechanics. Just common sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/2c22f50e68b8ae25349f4229e73d972b.poster.avif?t=1769151080\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/2c22f50e68b8ae25349f4229e73d972b.webm?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/2c22f50e68b8ae25349f4229e73d972b.mp4?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/8c752e2d3d710c07615f52b918268a1e.poster.avif?t=1769151080\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/8c752e2d3d710c07615f52b918268a1e.webm?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/8c752e2d3d710c07615f52b918268a1e.mp4?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your strongest weapon? Common sense + Imagination</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So the Zeds got an upgrade in the muscles and brains department. A pointy stick just isn't going to cut it anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get creative! Any junk you have is ready to be fused into a powerful new weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tape a curling iron to a selfie stick and get ready to toast some zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mount a GPU on a toilet brush for the perfect &quot;anti-Zed&quot; battleaxe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a Zed head into your new favorite tool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this apocalypse, imagination is your ultimate weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/4753cc6de8e3c27aca9bec821bf4b62e.poster.avif?t=1769151080\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/4753cc6de8e3c27aca9bec821bf4b62e.webm?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/4753cc6de8e3c27aca9bec821bf4b62e.mp4?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There are other survivors...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life is terrible but hey, it's equally awful for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not alone. Thousands of survivors share this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See that bridge? Someone built that. It just saves your skin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what's your move? Leave a medkit to pay it forward? Or some poison to thin the herd?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate or sabotage. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/6c1a7b6b56cbafaa26a29ecdd8ec2c06.poster.avif?t=1769151080\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/6c1a7b6b56cbafaa26a29ecdd8ec2c06.webm?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An opportunity to rebuild the world from the ground up.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with other survivors and build &quot;wonders&quot; that will lead to a very different ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You could build a rocket, fill it with survivors, and fly off to a new planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, you know, do the hard work of developing a vaccine and save everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You could build a tower to the clouds and start civilization there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure, but every single thing you do might just rewrite the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like we've said before, civilization just collapsed, and you're here at the beginning of everything. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/ca3acdfbb763a81fce79cc7eee698e48.poster.avif?t=1769151080\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/ca3acdfbb763a81fce79cc7eee698e48.webm?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3371050?t=1769151080","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/dfbb546c70b630edc48163afae9365d5ad4fc5d5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769151080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/dd2d5019709cf16e65db5fce087ffe9d78a58eaa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769151080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/dd2d5019709cf16e65db5fce087ffe9d78a58eaa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769151080","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/9b359741b83600f64a78f94a4a961163.avif?t=1769151080\" width=1560 height=1650 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord \ud83d\udc49\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Someone hit the pause button on civilization...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is gone. Or is it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't the aftermath of the apocalypse. This is the first minute of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, the water's still running... if you fancy a night of gut-wrenching agony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your neighbor's lights are on, but they've got a bit of a zombie problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it's a commuter's dream right now because traffic laws are dead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't think of this as the end of the world. Think of it as the very first, chaotic day of the new world order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/23c1990f628c021a7cb73fd01dba80eb.poster.avif?t=1769151080\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/23c1990f628c021a7cb73fd01dba80eb.webm?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/23c1990f628c021a7cb73fd01dba80eb.mp4?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Common sense. It's the new superpower.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, don't overthink it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thirsty? Bust open a vending machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry? Raid someone's pantry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bitten? Welcome to the undead club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex rules. No punishing mechanics. Just common sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/2c22f50e68b8ae25349f4229e73d972b.poster.avif?t=1769151080\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/2c22f50e68b8ae25349f4229e73d972b.webm?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/2c22f50e68b8ae25349f4229e73d972b.mp4?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/8c752e2d3d710c07615f52b918268a1e.poster.avif?t=1769151080\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/8c752e2d3d710c07615f52b918268a1e.webm?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/8c752e2d3d710c07615f52b918268a1e.mp4?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your strongest weapon? Common sense + Imagination</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So the Zeds got an upgrade in the muscles and brains department. A pointy stick just isn't going to cut it anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get creative! Any junk you have is ready to be fused into a powerful new weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tape a curling iron to a selfie stick and get ready to toast some zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mount a GPU on a toilet brush for the perfect &quot;anti-Zed&quot; battleaxe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a Zed head into your new favorite tool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this apocalypse, imagination is your ultimate weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/4753cc6de8e3c27aca9bec821bf4b62e.poster.avif?t=1769151080\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/4753cc6de8e3c27aca9bec821bf4b62e.webm?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/4753cc6de8e3c27aca9bec821bf4b62e.mp4?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There are other survivors...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life is terrible but hey, it's equally awful for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not alone. Thousands of survivors share this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See that bridge? Someone built that. It just saves your skin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what's your move? Leave a medkit to pay it forward? Or some poison to thin the herd?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate or sabotage. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/6c1a7b6b56cbafaa26a29ecdd8ec2c06.poster.avif?t=1769151080\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/6c1a7b6b56cbafaa26a29ecdd8ec2c06.webm?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An opportunity to rebuild the world from the ground up.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with other survivors and build &quot;wonders&quot; that will lead to a very different ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You could build a rocket, fill it with survivors, and fly off to a new planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, you know, do the hard work of developing a vaccine and save everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You could build a tower to the clouds and start civilization there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure, but every single thing you do might just rewrite the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like we've said before, civilization just collapsed, and you're here at the beginning of everything. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/ca3acdfbb763a81fce79cc7eee698e48.poster.avif?t=1769151080\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/ca3acdfbb763a81fce79cc7eee698e48.webm?t=1769151080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Quantum Quirks"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/7dfc2de8892422bed46023c2e588d934e78a598d/header.jpg?t=1769151080","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3371050/2008091473/a51495a8da6d89e5ab53dbbe3